# Decision log

After any meaningful code change, append an entry to `decisions.md` in the same turn. Do not wait until the end of the session.

Each entry must include:
- Date and short title
- Decision (what was chosen)
- Alternatives considered
- Why this option won (library, pattern, or tradeoff)
- What was rejected and the cost of that rejection

Log choices such as: library vs library, folder layout, API shape, where logic lives, persistence, date/money rounding, and UI patterns.

Do not make an undocumented architectural choice. If a decision is reversed later, add a new entry that points at the old one.
